      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "PF Easy: how this workflow works",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**EASY v2 \u2014 the whole sprite pipeline in 3 nodes**\n\n1. **H3 Sprite Prompt (Easy v2)** \u2014 character + action + style + seconds; prompt & length wire straight into `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo`.\n2. **Sprite Studio (Easy v2)** \u2014 raw frames in, game-ready sprite run out. Pick size / look / palette / background; inside it runs grid recover -> motion fix -> chroma key -> quantize/TruePixel -> crop -> loop -> dedup.\n3. **Sprite Export (Easy v2)** \u2014 GIF + sprite sheet (+ optional Aseprite build). Set a name, hit run.\n\nNeed a knob the Easy nodes hide? The full PixelForge node set is still there under `PixelForge/*` \u2014 both coexist."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
